# Captured network data holds live session tokens and account history.
# Drop recordings in har/ — the whole folder is ignored, and CI rejects a pull
# request that carries one anyway. Run `pnpm sanitize-har` before sharing.
har/
*.har
*.har.com
*.sanitized.har
